  description="The terms and conditions that govern your use of FountainFinances.com, including educational-use limits, intellectual property, third-party links and liability."
  lede="Please read these terms carefully. By using the Site, you agree to them."
>
  <h2 id="acceptance">1. Acceptance of these terms</h2>
  <p>These Terms of Use (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of <strong>{SITE.domain}</strong> and its content, calculators and features (the “Site”), operated by Fountain Finances (“we,” “us”). By using the Site you agree to these Terms and to our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree, do not use the Site.</p>

  <h2 id="education">2. Educational information only — no advice</h2>
  <p>The Site provides general educational information and comparisons about personal finance products and topics. <strong>We are not a bank, lender, broker, insurer, credit counselor, tax preparer, attorney or registered investment adviser</strong>, and nothing on the Site is individualized financial, investment, tax, legal or credit advice, or an offer or solicitation to buy or sell any product. You are solely responsible for your financial decisions. Consider consulting a qualified professional about your circumstances. See our <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="accuracy">3. Accuracy of information</h2>
  <p>We work hard to keep information accurate and current, but financial products, rates, fees, terms and laws change frequently. We do not guarantee that any information on the Site is complete, accurate or up to date. Always confirm rates, fees, eligibility and terms directly with the provider before applying for or purchasing any product.</p>

